{"id": "glm2_caesar_shift", "signature": "solve(s, n)", "statement": "Given a string s and an integer n (which may be negative or larger than 26), return s with every lowercase letter shifted forward by n positions in the alphabet, wrapping around (z followed by a). All other characters, including uppercase letters, digits, spaces and punctuation, are left unchanged. The empty string returns the empty string.", "tests": [{"args": ["abc", 1], "expected": "bcd"}, {"args": ["xyz", 3], "expected": "abc"}, {"args": ["Hello, World!", 0], "expected": "Hello, World!"}, {"args": ["abc", 0], "expected": "abc"}, {"args": ["abc", 29], "expected": "def"}, {"args": ["abc", -1], "expected": "zab"}, {"args": ["", 5], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["a b", 25], "expected": "z a"}, {"args": ["z", 1], "expected": "a"}, {"args": ["attack at dawn", 13], "expected": "nggnpx ng qnja"}, {"args": ["a", -27], "expected": "z"}, {"args": ["Zz", 1], "expected": "Za"}], "facts": [["arg", "s", "string"], ["arg", "n", "int"], ["iterate", "s"], ["ask", "shift_letters"], ["shift_by", "n"]], "deps": {"schema": ["char_shift"], "uses": ["caesar_shift"], "solution_sha256": "4a2d045f5fdf04015bb671d7681cb679e37f8b0bd8bc5971639375bfe0ba6285", "reference_sha256": "5d16be7ba4a1fc47ab58bde6c11372a1456a28d1b1b2e1259cd683dba301525e"}}